      "type": "string",
      "description": "This ID is a permanent link between the unique shipment being quoted and the quote offered by C.H. Robinson - it is normally the primary shipment reference number, a value that should not change during the lifecycle of the shipment. The same transactionId should be submitted in the rate request when re-rating the same shipment. \n\n ### <span style=\"color:Red\">**Required for Truckload Quoting</span>"
    },
